{"hw":"ἐπιστήμη","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐπιστήμη</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπιστήμη</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ἐπίσταμαι</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">acquaintance with</b> a matter, <b class=\"lex-tr\">understanding</b>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">skill</b>, as in archery, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1057</span> </span>; in war, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.121</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.72</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.62</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐ. πρὸς τὸν πόλεμον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">33.7</span> </span> (fort. leg. <span class=\"gk\">περί</span>) <span class=\"gk\"> περὶ τὰ μαθήματα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phlb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">55d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῦ νεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Grg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">511c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπιστήμῃ</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">skilfully</b>, <span class=\"gk\">οἱ μὴ ἐ. τοὺς ἐπαίνους</span> <span class=\"gk\">ποιούμενοι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plot.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.5.13</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span>. <b class=\"lex-tr\">professional skill</b>: hence, <b class=\"lex-tr\">profession</b>, <span class=\"gk\">οἱ τὴν ἰατρικὴν ἐ. μεταχειριζόμενοι</span>